.TH tkutags n 0.29.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkutags \- tag editor with removable chips
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkutags
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkutags::widget .t]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tags shown as removable chips plus an input row (combobox with \-suggestions,
else entry). Duplicates and blanks ignored; \-readonly omits editing controls.
See docs/tkutags.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkuform(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, tags, chips
